# Flutter client source (workin_mobile, workin_desktop), imported locally
# for read-only Discovery (A1/PMR-02). This is a PERMANENT policy, not a
# temporary safeguard for this Discovery pass — both clients are
# independent product repositories with their own history and release
# tooling, and hr-platform's CLAUDE.md scopes this repo to
# planning/documentation/governance, not hosting product source. See
# ADR-0001 (docs/adr/ADR-0001-repository-strategy.md) for the full
# reassessment. Never commit this product source or its embedded
# configuration/credentials into hr-platform. This rule does not block
# documentation, ADRs, or contract specs that reference or are derived
# from Flutter source — those live under docs/ and are unaffected.
flutter-integration/workin_desktop/
flutter-integration/workin_mobile/
